{================================================================================
 Script Name : _Research_Adaptive_Farmer_v15
 MC Load Name: STRATEGY_WILLY_SHORT_CTEST2
 Description : Consolidation Short - S_Spring (v15 research: dual-path entry)
 Version     : v15.1 (research; based on v14.4 PRODUCTION)
 Symbol      : TXF1 (Taiwan Stock Index Futures Front Month)
 Platform    : MultiCharts 9.0 PowerLanguage x64
 Timeframe   : Data1 = 15M / Data2 = 60M / Data3 = Daily

 CHANGELOG:
   v14.0 - v14.4  See live/L4_ConsolidationShort.pla for full history.

   v15.0  (2026-07-26) Macro Block OR condition removal.

          THE PROBLEM:
            v14.4 Macro Block = (Close > SlowMA60 AND MA rising)
                                OR (FastMA20 > SlowMA60)
            The OR condition (golden cross) blocks ALL entries for
            the entire duration of a bull market. 2026 result:
            163/163 days blocked = zero trades for 14+ months.
            Even -12 pct corrections (35K->31K, 49K->43K) did NOT
            break the golden cross -> strategy completely dormant.

          THE FIX:
            Remove the OR condition. Keep only the AND condition:
              v_Macro_Block = (Close > SlowMA60 AND SlowMA60 rising)
            This blocks only when price is ABOVE the 60-day MA AND
            the MA is still trending up. Allows entries when:
              - Close drops below SlowMA60 (correction underway)
              - OR SlowMA60 starts declining (momentum shift)

          WHAT DOES NOT CHANGE:
            - v_Trend_Dir = -1 (60M Close < WeeklyMA48) still
              required for entry -> double directional protection
            - All exit logic, stop levels, trail, BE/SP code intact
            - Holiday/Settlement/Night blocks intact
            - P3b Immediate Stop Guard intact

          EXPECTED IMPACT:
            More entries during bull market corrections. The
            v_Trend_Dir gate on 60M prevents blind contrarian
            shorting -- price must be below the 60M weekly MA
            for an entry to fire.

          RISK:
            New entries in pullbacks may be lower quality; watch
            for CS_BreakExit rate increase on the new trades.
            The original OR condition was conservative by design;
            removing it trades activity for potential loss.

 PERFORMANCE (v14.4 baseline, 1-lot, 1M capital):
   Net Profit    : 687,200 TWD
   Profit Factor : 1.83
   MDD           : -239,800
   Total Trades  : 84
   Backtest      : 2020/02/19 - 2026/06/06

 PERFORMANCE (v15.0 -- FAILED):
   Net Profit    : 530,800 (vs 912,800 baseline = -41.8%)
   Profit Factor : 1.180  (vs 1.563 baseline)
   MDD           : -1,142,800 (-38.9%) -- UNACCEPTABLE
   Total Trades  : 122 (+42 new trades, all net -382K)
   2026 trades   : STILL ZERO -- OR removal alone did not solve

   v15.0 LESSON: the OR filter protected against premature entries
   in bull market pullbacks. 42 new trades were toxic (avg -9,095).
   CS_BreakExit exploded to 39 trades at 0% win rate (-1.6M).
   Removing the OR alone makes the strategy WORSE.

   v15.1  (2026-07-26) Dual-path entry: Trap + Pressure Zone.

          THE INSIGHT (from user):
            The OR still needs removal, BUT the entry logic itself
            is too restrictive. Requiring a false breakout above
            Box_Top as the ONLY entry path means:
            - Price must first break OUT above box top
            - Then fall BACK below trigger price
            In 2026 corrections, price approaches resistance but
            never breaks out -- the trap never fires.

          THE FIX (mirrors L3 Support Zone architecture):
            L3 enters long when Close drops into the bottom portion
            of the box (Support Zone = Box_Btm + Range * 50%).
            L4 v15.1 mirrors this: enter short when High reaches
            the top portion of the box (Pressure Zone) WITHOUT
            requiring an actual breakout above Box_Top.

          DUAL-PATH ARCHITECTURE:
            Path A (CS_Entry): False breakout trap (existing)
              High > Box_Top -> trap armed -> Close < trigger -> entry
            Path B (CS_PEntry): Pressure zone rejection (NEW)
              High approaches Box_Top within ATR*Pressure_ATR_Mult
              -> pressure armed -> Close < trigger -> entry
            Path A has priority (stronger signal). Path B fires
            only when no trap zone is active.

          SEPARATE LABELS FOR RESEARCH:
            CS_Entry  = trap-triggered entry (original path)
            CS_PEntry = pressure-triggered entry (new path)
            Same exit chain applies to both. Labels allow
            backtest analysis of which path contributes what.

 PERFORMANCE (v15.1 -- PENDING MC BACKTEST):
   Net Profit    : TBD
   Profit Factor : TBD
   MDD           : TBD
   Total Trades  : TBD

 v15.1 DELTA vs v14.4:
   Phase 0 Macro Block: removed OR golden-cross condition (from v15.0)
   Dead code cleanup  : removed FastMA input/var/computation (from v15.0)
   Phase 2 Entry      : added Pressure Zone path (CS_PEntry)
   New inputs         : Pressure_Entry_On, Pressure_ATR_Mult
   New variable       : v_In_Pressure_Zone
   Risk level         : MEDIUM (new entry path generates more trades)
================================================================================}

[IntrabarOrderGeneration = false]

inputs:
    { --- 0. Master Environment Filter (Data3 - Daily) --- }
    Daily_SlowMA_Len(60),

    { --- 1. Commander Logic Parameters (Data2 - 60M) --- }
    Lookback_Bars(15),
    Range_Shrink_Rate(0.7),
    Weekly_MA_Len(48),

    { --- 2. Risk & Volatility Parameters (Data1 - 15M) --- }
    ATR_Length(60),
    ATR_Stop_Mult(2),

    { --- 3. Tactical Entry Parameters (S_Spring only) --- }
    i_Buffer_ATR_Mult(0.4),
    Time_Limit_Bars(6),

    { --- 4. Advanced Management --- }
    Cooldown_Bars(8),
    Time_Stop_Bars(60),
    Trail_ATR_Mult(1.0),

    { --- 5. v14.1 Frozen Initial SL --- }
    Freeze_SL_On(true),

    { --- 6. Holiday Flat Rule v3 (Iron Rule 2026-06-13) --- }
    Holiday_Flat_Time(415),
    Registry_Valid_Until(1270101),
    Manual_Kill_Switch(false),

    { --- 6b. Monthly Settlement Flat (2026-06-17 added) --- }
    Settlement_Flat_Time(1230),

    { --- 7. v14.2 Path A - Night entry block --- }
    Night_Block_On(true),

    { --- 8. v14.2 Path B - Breakeven (REJECTED, code kept for research) --- }
    BE_Trigger_Pts(0),
    BE_Offset_Pts(5),

    { --- 9. v14.2 Path B - StopProfit (REJECTED, code kept for research) --- }
    SP_Trigger_Pts(0),
    SP_Retain_Pct(50),

    { --- 10. v15.1 Pressure Zone Entry (NEW) --- }
    Pressure_Entry_On(true),
    Pressure_ATR_Mult(1.0);

variables:
    { Phase 0: Macro filter }
    v_Daily_SlowMA(0),
    v_Macro_Block(false),

    { Phase 1: Box definition }
    v_Ref_High(0),
    v_Ref_Low(0),
    v_Curr_Range(0),
    v_Ref_Range(0),
    v_is_in_consolidation(false),
    v_Box_Top(0),
    v_Box_Btm(0),
    v_Weekly_MA(0),
    v_Trend_Dir(0),

    { Phase 2: Execution variables }
    v_Current_ATR(0),
    v_Trigger_Price(0),
    v_Stop_Level(0),
    v_In_Trap_Zone(false),
    v_Trap_Counter(0),
    v_In_Pressure_Zone(false),
    v_Night_Block(false),

    { Phase 3: Advanced Management Variables }
    v_Locked_Top(0),
    v_Locked_Btm(0),
    v_BarsSinceExit(999),
    v_Lowest_Low(999999),
    v_Trail_Active(false),

    { v14.1 Frozen Initial SL }
    v_SL_Locked(false),
    v_Frozen_ATR(0),
    v_Frozen_LockedTop(0),

    { Holiday Flat Rule v3 }
    v_Holiday_Block(false),
    v_Registry_Expired(false),
    Registry_Warn_ID(-1),
    hidx(0),

    { Settlement Day }
    v_Settlement_Day(false),

    { v14.2 Path B - close-based MFE peak (in points) }
    v_Peak_Profit_Pts(0),
    v_BE_Armed(false),
    v_SP_Armed(false),
    v_BE_Floor(0),
    v_SP_Floor(0),
    v_Effective_Stop(0),

    { Exit chain }
    ExitFired(0);

arrays:
    Holiday_Tail[80](0);

{ ==========================================
  Phase -1: Holiday Tail Registry (TAIFEX-verified, shared
  with L1/L2/L3). Holiday_Tail = last trading day + 1 calendar
  day = the date stamped on the 00:00-05:00 tail bars of the
  final night session before each closure. * = reconstructed.
  ========================================== }

if CurrentBar = 1 then begin
    Holiday_Tail[1]  = 1190913;  Holiday_Tail[2]  = 1191010;
    Holiday_Tail[3]  = 1200101;
    { 2020 } Holiday_Tail[4]  = 1200121;  Holiday_Tail[5]  = 1200228;
    Holiday_Tail[6]  = 1200402;  Holiday_Tail[7]  = 1200501;
    Holiday_Tail[8]  = 1200625;  Holiday_Tail[9]  = 1201001;
    Holiday_Tail[10] = 1201009;  Holiday_Tail[11] = 1210101;
    { 2021 } Holiday_Tail[12] = 1210206;  Holiday_Tail[13] = 1210227;
    Holiday_Tail[14] = 1210402;  Holiday_Tail[15] = 1210612;
    Holiday_Tail[16] = 1210918;  Holiday_Tail[17] = 1211009;
    Holiday_Tail[18] = 1211231;
    { 2022 } Holiday_Tail[19] = 1220127;  Holiday_Tail[20] = 1220226;
    Holiday_Tail[21] = 1220402;  Holiday_Tail[22] = 1220430;
    Holiday_Tail[23] = 1220603;  Holiday_Tail[24] = 1220909;
    Holiday_Tail[25] = 1221008;  Holiday_Tail[26] = 1221231;
    { 2023 } Holiday_Tail[27] = 1230118;  Holiday_Tail[28] = 1230225;
    Holiday_Tail[29] = 1230401;  Holiday_Tail[30] = 1230429;
    Holiday_Tail[31] = 1230622;  Holiday_Tail[32] = 1230929;
    Holiday_Tail[33] = 1231007;  Holiday_Tail[34] = 1231230;
    { 2024 } Holiday_Tail[35] = 1240206;  Holiday_Tail[36] = 1240228;
    Holiday_Tail[37] = 1240404;  Holiday_Tail[38] = 1240501;
    Holiday_Tail[39] = 1240608;  Holiday_Tail[40] = 1240917;
    Holiday_Tail[41] = 1241010;  Holiday_Tail[42] = 1250101;
    { 2025 (* pending vs 114-yr PDF) }
    Holiday_Tail[43] = 1250123;  Holiday_Tail[44] = 1250228;
    Holiday_Tail[45] = 1250403;  Holiday_Tail[46] = 1250501;
    Holiday_Tail[47] = 1250530;  Holiday_Tail[48] = 1250927;
    Holiday_Tail[49] = 1251004;  Holiday_Tail[50] = 1251010;
    Holiday_Tail[51] = 1251024;  Holiday_Tail[52] = 1251225;
    Holiday_Tail[53] = 1260101;
    { 2026 (verified: TAIFEX official 115-yr calendar) }
    Holiday_Tail[54] = 1260212;  Holiday_Tail[55] = 1260227;
    Holiday_Tail[56] = 1260403;  Holiday_Tail[57] = 1260501;
    Holiday_Tail[58] = 1260619;  Holiday_Tail[59] = 1260925;
    Holiday_Tail[60] = 1261009;  Holiday_Tail[61] = 1261024;
    Holiday_Tail[62] = 1261225;  Holiday_Tail[63] = 1270101;
    { 2027 CNY onward: rebuild from TAIFEX 116-yr calendar in Q4 2026 }
end;

v_Holiday_Block = false;

if Time <= 500 then begin
    for hidx = 1 to 80 begin
        if Date = Holiday_Tail[hidx] then
            v_Holiday_Block = true;
    end;
end;

v_Registry_Expired = false;

if Date > Registry_Valid_Until then begin
    v_Registry_Expired = true;
    v_Holiday_Block    = true;
end;

{ Monthly Settlement Day detection (3rd Wed of month) }
v_Settlement_Day = (DayOfWeek(Date) = 3) and
                   (DayOfMonth(Date) >= 15) and
                   (DayOfMonth(Date) <= 21);

if LastBarOnChart and
   DateToJulian(Date) >= DateToJulian(Registry_Valid_Until) - 30 then begin
    if Registry_Warn_ID < 0 then begin
        Registry_Warn_ID = Text_New(Date, Time, High + 400,
            "HOLIDAY REGISTRY EXPIRES " +
            NumToStr(Registry_Valid_Until, 0) +
            " - REBUILD FROM TAIFEX CALENDAR");
        Text_SetColor(Registry_Warn_ID, Red);
        Text_SetSize(Registry_Warn_ID, 14);
        Text_SetAttribute(Registry_Warn_ID, 1, true);
    end;
end;

{ ==========================================
  v14.2 Path A: Night entry block (02:00-04:59)
  TXF1 dead-of-night session has thin liquidity. Diagnostic
  found 9 entries at this window, all losers (net -120,800),
  ZERO of them being CS_BreakExit cases. Pure noise.
  ========================================== }

v_Night_Block = false;
if Night_Block_On = true and Time >= 200 and Time < 500 then
    v_Night_Block = true;

{ ==========================================
  Phase 0: Master Environment Filter (Data3 - Daily)
  v15.0: removed OR condition (FastMA > SlowMA golden cross).
  Golden cross persisted through entire 2026 bull market
  (163/163 days = 100 pct blocked) despite -12 pct corrections.
  Retained AND condition: block only when Close is above SlowMA60
  AND SlowMA60 is still rising (confirmed strong uptrend).
  v_Trend_Dir on 60M provides secondary directional protection.
  ========================================== }

v_Daily_SlowMA = Average(Close, Daily_SlowMA_Len) of Data3;

if (Close of Data3 > v_Daily_SlowMA) and
   (v_Daily_SlowMA >= v_Daily_SlowMA[1]) then begin
    v_Macro_Block = true;
end else begin
    v_Macro_Block = false;
end;

{ ==========================================
  Phase 1: Macro Commander Logic (Data2 - 60M)
  ========================================== }

v_Ref_High   = Highest(High, Lookback_Bars)[1] of Data2;
v_Ref_Low    = Lowest(Low,   Lookback_Bars)[1] of Data2;
v_Curr_Range = (High of Data2) - (Low of Data2);
v_Ref_Range  = v_Ref_High - v_Ref_Low;

v_Weekly_MA = Average(Close, Weekly_MA_Len) of Data2;

if Close of Data2 < v_Weekly_MA then
    v_Trend_Dir = -1
else
    v_Trend_Dir = 1;

if (High of Data2 <= v_Ref_High) and (Low of Data2 >= v_Ref_Low) then begin
    if v_Ref_Range > 0 and
       (v_Curr_Range / v_Ref_Range <= Range_Shrink_Rate) then begin
        v_is_in_consolidation = true;
        v_Box_Top = v_Ref_High;
        v_Box_Btm = v_Ref_Low;
    end;
end;

if v_is_in_consolidation then begin
    if (Close of Data2 > v_Box_Top) or
       (Close of Data2 < v_Box_Btm) then
        v_is_in_consolidation = false;
end;

{ ==========================================
  Phase 2: Tactical Execution Engine (Data1 - 15M)
  ========================================== }

v_Current_ATR = AvgTrueRange(ATR_Length);

{ Cooldown Counter Management }
if MarketPosition <> 0 then
    v_BarsSinceExit = 0
else if MarketPosition = 0 and MarketPosition[1] <> 0 then
    v_BarsSinceExit = 1
else if MarketPosition = 0 then
    v_BarsSinceExit = v_BarsSinceExit + 1;

if v_is_in_consolidation and v_Box_Top > v_Box_Btm then begin

    { Sub-Phase A1: False Breakout (Trap) Detection -- original path }
    if High > v_Box_Top then begin
        v_In_Trap_Zone = true;
        v_Trap_Counter = 0;
    end;

    { Time decay: trap zone expires after Time_Limit_Bars }
    if v_In_Trap_Zone then begin
        v_Trap_Counter = v_Trap_Counter + 1;
        if v_Trap_Counter > Time_Limit_Bars then
            v_In_Trap_Zone = false;
    end;

    { Sub-Phase A2: Pressure Zone Detection (v15.1 NEW)
      Mirrors L3 Support Zone: price approaches Box_Top resistance
      without requiring an actual breakout. Activates when High
      reaches within Pressure_ATR_Mult * ATR of Box_Top.
      Only fires when no trap zone is active (trap has priority).
      Recalculated every bar (no time decay needed -- the condition
      is current, not event-driven). }
    v_In_Pressure_Zone = false;
    if Pressure_Entry_On = true and
       v_In_Trap_Zone = false and
       High >= v_Box_Top - (v_Current_ATR * Pressure_ATR_Mult) then begin
        v_In_Pressure_Zone = true;
    end;

    { P3b: Immediate Stop Guard -- entry-bar protection (2026-06-18)
      SetStopLoss is MC engine-level: active on entry bar, no IOG dependency.
      Only called when not short -> freezes at signal-bar box snapshot. }
    if MarketPosition >= 0 then
        SetStopLoss(AbsValue((v_Box_Top + v_Current_ATR * ATR_Stop_Mult) - Close)
                    * BigPointValue);

    { Sub-Phase B: Dual-Path Entry Execution
      Path A (CS_Entry):  trap-triggered (breakout above Box_Top -> pullback)
      Path B (CS_PEntry): pressure-triggered (approach Box_Top -> rejection)
      Trap takes priority via the if/else. Same trigger price, same
      exit chain, same stop levels. Labels differ for research analysis. }
    v_Trigger_Price = v_Box_Top - (v_Current_ATR * i_Buffer_ATR_Mult);

    if MarketPosition    =  0             and
       v_BarsSinceExit  >= Cooldown_Bars  and
       v_Trend_Dir       = -1             and
       v_Macro_Block     = false          and
       (v_In_Trap_Zone = true or v_In_Pressure_Zone = true) and
       Close             < v_Trigger_Price and
       v_Holiday_Block   = false          and
       v_Night_Block     = false          and
       v_Settlement_Day  = false          then begin

        if v_In_Trap_Zone = true then
            SellShort ("CS_Entry") next bar at Market
        else
            SellShort ("CS_PEntry") next bar at Market;

        v_In_Trap_Zone = false;
        v_In_Pressure_Zone = false;

    end;

end;

{ ==========================================
  Phase 3: Exit Logic and State Lock Defense
  ========================================== }

{ Snapshot box and reset tracking when flat }
if MarketPosition = 0 then begin
    if v_is_in_consolidation then begin
        v_Locked_Top = v_Box_Top;
        v_Locked_Btm = v_Box_Btm;
    end;
    v_Lowest_Low       = 999999;
    v_Trail_Active     = false;
    v_SL_Locked        = false;
    v_Frozen_ATR       = 0;
    v_Frozen_LockedTop = 0;
    v_Peak_Profit_Pts  = 0;
    v_BE_Armed         = false;
    v_SP_Armed         = false;
    v_BE_Floor         = 0;
    v_SP_Floor         = 0;
end;

if MarketPosition = -1 then begin

    { 1. Record Maximum Favorable Excursion }
    if Low < v_Lowest_Low then
        v_Lowest_Low = Low;

    { 2. Trailing Stop Activation }
    if v_Lowest_Low <= v_Locked_Btm then
        v_Trail_Active = true;

    { 3. v14.1 Freeze: lock ATR + LockedTop ONCE on entry bar }
    if Freeze_SL_On and v_SL_Locked = false then begin
        v_Frozen_ATR       = v_Current_ATR;
        v_Frozen_LockedTop = v_Locked_Top;
        v_SL_Locked        = true;
    end;

    { 4. Stop Level Calculation (v14.1 logic, unchanged) }
    if v_Trail_Active then begin
        { Trail layer: by design uses CURRENT ATR to track volatility }
        v_Stop_Level = MinList(v_Stop_Level[1],
            v_Lowest_Low + (Trail_ATR_Mult * v_Current_ATR));
    end else begin
        if Freeze_SL_On then begin
            { Frozen path: ATR + Top locked at entry; no drift on reload }
            v_Stop_Level = v_Frozen_LockedTop + (ATR_Stop_Mult * v_Frozen_ATR);
        end else begin
            { v14.0 dynamic path: ATR floats, Top ratchets down }
            v_Stop_Level = v_Locked_Top + (ATR_Stop_Mult * v_Current_ATR);
            if v_Box_Top < v_Locked_Top and v_Box_Top > 0 then
                v_Locked_Top = v_Box_Top;
        end;
    end;

    { 5. v14.2 Path B: BE / SP arming + floor computation
         For SHORT positions:
           Profit = EntryPrice - Close (positive when price drops)
           BE floor = EntryPrice - BE_Offset_Pts (lock X pts profit)
           SP floor = EntryPrice - Peak * (1 - Retain/100)
         Both floors are LOWER than initial v_Stop_Level (which
         starts above entry). When applied via MinList, they
         tighten the buy-back price downward.

         Close-based arming (matches L1 StopProfit pattern).
         Once armed, never disarms until flat. }

    if EntryPrice - Close > v_Peak_Profit_Pts then
        v_Peak_Profit_Pts = EntryPrice - Close;

    if BE_Trigger_Pts > 0 and v_Peak_Profit_Pts >= BE_Trigger_Pts then
        v_BE_Armed = true;
    if SP_Trigger_Pts > 0 and v_Peak_Profit_Pts >= SP_Trigger_Pts then
        v_SP_Armed = true;

    if v_BE_Armed then
        v_BE_Floor = EntryPrice - BE_Offset_Pts;
    if v_SP_Armed then
        v_SP_Floor = EntryPrice -
            (v_Peak_Profit_Pts * (1 - SP_Retain_Pct / 100));

    { 6. Exit Chain with Priority Gates }
    ExitFired = 0;

    { Priority 0 - Manual Kill }
    if (ExitFired = 0) and Manual_Kill_Switch then begin
        BuyToCover ("CS_Kill") next bar at Market;
        ExitFired = 1;
    end;

    { Priority 0 - Registry Fail-Safe }
    if (ExitFired = 0) and v_Registry_Expired then begin
        BuyToCover ("CS_RegistryEnd") next bar at Market;
        ExitFired = 1;
    end;

    { Priority 0 - Holiday Iron Rule }
    if (ExitFired = 0) and v_Holiday_Block and
       (Time >= Holiday_Flat_Time) then begin
        BuyToCover ("CS_Holiday") next bar at Market;
        ExitFired = 1;
    end;

    { Priority 0 - Monthly Settlement Flat }
    if (ExitFired = 0) and v_Settlement_Day and
       (Time >= Settlement_Flat_Time) then begin
        BuyToCover ("CS_Settlement") next bar at Market;
        ExitFired = 1;
    end;

    { Priority 1 - Disaster Control: box failed + upward break }
    if (ExitFired = 0) and
       (v_is_in_consolidation = false) and
       (Close of Data2 > v_Locked_Top) then begin
        BuyToCover ("CS_BreakExit") next bar at Market;
        ExitFired = 1;
    end;

    { Priority 2 - Time stop (only if trail not yet active) }
    if (ExitFired = 0) and
       (v_Trail_Active = false) and
       (BarsSinceEntry >= Time_Stop_Bars) then begin
        BuyToCover ("CS_TimeExit") next bar at Market;
        ExitFired = 1;
    end;

    { Priority 3 - Labeled Stop order (CS_SP > CS_BE > CS_SL).
      Mutually exclusive: tightest binding floor wins the label.
      SP_Floor / BE_Floor only "bind" when they are lower than
      the original v_Stop_Level (lower = tighter for shorts). }

    v_Effective_Stop = v_Stop_Level;

    if v_SP_Armed = true and
       v_SP_Floor > 0 and v_SP_Floor < v_Effective_Stop then begin
        v_Effective_Stop = v_SP_Floor;
        BuyToCover ("CS_SP") next bar at v_Effective_Stop Stop;
    end else if v_BE_Armed = true and
                v_BE_Floor > 0 and v_BE_Floor < v_Effective_Stop then begin
        v_Effective_Stop = v_BE_Floor;
        BuyToCover ("CS_BE") next bar at v_Effective_Stop Stop;
    end else begin
        BuyToCover ("CS_SL") next bar at v_Effective_Stop Stop;
    end;

end;
